							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							WoW formed in September 1999.<br />Notables should probably include Balerius and Valcare. <br />Original members were Balerius, Grum, Lach, Hardace, Golaen that I can remember.<br />WoW&#039;s only server first kill was THO which was quite humorous as I look back on it.<br />After Foolra, Corolinth, Sonard, Icelion were WoW guildleaders briefly before it transferred to me. I worked with Eelyen to form AoM and evidentually FoT. <br /><br />I retired from being an officer in February after being either a WoW officer(most of server history), WoW guildleader(couple of months), FoT officer (13 months), or FoT guildleader (measures in minutes - Eelyen trusted me to transfer leadership) over the period of four years. I still play and have a raid percentage over 90%.<br /><br />The split with Jeet occurred over the Vindicator of all mobs and WoW was not even aware EiE was offended until it showed up on flamevault. Was a shame as Jeet had always treated WoW well and had many friends within the guild. Many went on to join EiE later when WoW merged. <br /><br />Delheru&#039;s post brought back alot of memories and good friends. Well done.&nbsp; 
